<title>USA: Apache Corp Q4 net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Apache Corp Q4 net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Quarter		     Year</p>
<p>			1996	   1995	  1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Revenues    $304,641     $195,685    $977,151     $750,702</p>
<p>    Net Income   $51,198	 $8,545    $121,427	$20,207</p>
<p>Income per Common Share</p>
<p>			 $0.57	  $0.11	 $1.42	  $0.28</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares</p>
<p>		     89,999	 77,376	85,777	 71,792</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 net includes two charges totaling $14.6 million (after tax), or $0.20 per share, including a fourth-quarter charge of $5.9 million, or $0.08 per share, related to natural gas hedging activity.</p>
<p>		  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
